              "value": "Stretching Step"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(move)\n\nFrequency: 1/round\n\nTyrroicese forcefully extends a sticky pseudopod, plants it on a wall within 45 feet, and retracts the muscle.\n\nTyrroicese springs over to a space adjacent to the wall, moving through the intervening squares as normal but ignoring any difficult or greater difficult terrain."
            },
